ard_path": "src/brpc"}, "name": "RateLimitedBackupPolicyOptions", "qualified_name": "brpc.RateLimitedBackupPolicyOptions", "repo_id": "repo:074b46c6e95703171fcd66ba04121d7fcacc04ef0fa2e0085f37e49cc4137eac", "shard_id": "shard:f9ccb390ad085701357482a4410bd5544e4201fb3d4ba2c4f216e9892d1793b1", "signature": "struct", "source_hash": "6cefcd45c662f2948f605ffca3f85085ec03a544e1951b8a0f92e4fa3e1d5a94", "start_line": 45}, {"edge_metadata": {"document_path": "docs/cn/backup_request.md", "layer": "knowledge", "raw_evidence_link_id": "evidence:b4af9ca732efb544ac5a5aa9a98bcd09a17fe38de5bc6ac91123029be9c74d8e"}, "end_line": 83, "file_id": null, "generation": 1, "id": "documentsection:dcf07b60c9d54b6886a55e652c19b75f9f8bca778462868f93047202eabf1cff", "kind": "DocumentSection", "language": "markdown", "metadata": {"anchor": "51ec7f3ff1e31ea8", "content_hash": "7b05be8559713d153b25b1c43f3e53269b5494018a0927877f19212628fe2916", "document_id": "document:a65e374b63cd70e248f824edc65857111704ce567ad11bd32e222318d629940d", "document_type": "Document", "document_version": 109941659600342, "end_line": 83, "explicit_id": null, "heading_path": "�����server���Թ���һ������������ʱ / Backup Request ���� / ʹ��������������", "layer": "knowledge", "path": "docs/cn/backup_request.md", "start_line": 48, "text": "### ʹ��������������\n\n���� `CreateRateLimitedBackupPolicy` �����������ԣ����������õ� `ChannelOptions.backup_request_policy`��\n\n```c++\n#include \"brpc/backup_request_policy.h\"\n#include <memory>\n\nbrpc::RateLimitedBackupPolicyOptions opts;\nopts.backup_request_ms = 10;       // ����10msδ����ʱ����backup����\nopts.max_backup_ratio = 0.3;       // backup�����������30%\nopts.window_size_seconds = 10;     // �������ڿ��ȣ��룩\nopts.update_interval_seconds = 5;  // ���������ˢ�¼�����룩\n\n// CreateRateLimitedBackupPolicy���ص�ָ���ɵ��÷������ͷš�\n// policy���������ڱ��볤��channel����������channel��������policy��\nstd::unique_ptr<brpc::BackupRequestPolicy> policy(\n    brpc::CreateRateLimitedBackupPolicy(opts));\n\nbrpc::ChannelOptions options;\noptions.backup_request_policy = policy.get(); // Channel��ӵ�иö���\nchannel.Init(..., &options);\n// channel������policy����֮ǰ���١�\n```\n\n����˵����`RateLimitedBackupPolicyOptions`����\n\n| �ֶ� | Ĭ��ֵ | ˵�� |\n|------|--------|------|\n| `backup_request_ms` | -1 | ��ʱ��ֵ�����룩��-1 ��ʾ�̳� `ChannelOptions.backup_request_ms`������ͨ�� `ChannelOptions.backup_request_policy` ���ò���ʱ��Ч��ͨ�� Controller ע��ʱû�� channel ���Ļ���ֵ��Ӧ��ʽָ�� >= 0 ��ֵ�������� >= -1�� |\n| `max_backup_ratio` | 0.1 | backup�������ޣ�ȡֵ��Χ (0, 1] |\n| `window_size_seconds` | 10 | �������ڿ��ȣ��룩��ȡֵ��Χ [1, 3600] |\n| `update_interval_seconds` | 5 | ����ˢ�¼�����룩������ >= 1 |\n\n�������Ϸ�ʱ `CreateRateLimitedBackupPolicy` ���� `nullptr`��\n", "title": "ʹ��������������"}, "name": "ʹ��������������", "qualified_name": "docs/cn/backup_request.md#51ec7f3ff1e31ea8", "relation": "DOCUMENTS", "repo_id": "repo:074b46c6e95703171fcd66ba04121d7fcacc04ef0fa2e0085f37e49cc4137eac", "shard_id": null, "signature": null, "source_hash": "7b05be8559713d153b25b1c43f3e53269b5494018a0927877f19212628fe2916", "start_line": 48}, {"edge_metadata": {"document_path": "docs/en/backup_request.md", "layer": "knowledge", "raw_evidence_link_id": "evidence:6c22999e0a382cfd836a2672880fcbb56e611802cd073bd14b38b2a72f2b57b5"}, "end_line": 83, "file_id": null, "generation": 1, "id": "documentsection:987ee30623980271e8c1c6343f5c2629c73f7b00168896845e941fe8772eb2e1", "kind": "DocumentSection", "language": "markdown", "metadata": {"anchor": "c2468c9d42c0dc4c", "content_hash": "0856cd97edcf079acd24645de92589ccec2c0dd4a70b42aceb8e5c4532edd896", "document_id": "document:c0778cb30f8a1417562a237ffcf4d7656e8170fdd20a696923b7b5ec93ccb2f3", "document_type": "Document", "document_version": 108798212291126, "end_line": 83, "explicit_id": null, "heading_path": "When backend servers can be hung in a naming service / Rate-limited backup requests / Using the built-in rate-limiting policy", "layer": "knowledge", "path": "docs/en/backup_request.md", "start_line": 48, "text": "### Using the built-in rate-limiting policy\n\nCall `CreateRateLimitedBackupPolicy` and set the result on `ChannelOptions.backup_request_policy`:\n\n```c++\n#include \"brpc/backup_request_policy.h\"\n#include <memory>\n\nbrpc::RateLimitedBackupPolicyOptions opts;\nopts.backup_request_ms = 10;       // send backup if RPC does not complete within 10ms\nopts.max_backup_ratio = 0.3;       // cap backup requests at 30% of total\nopts.window_size_seconds = 10;     // sliding window width in seconds\nopts.update_interval_seconds = 5;  // how often the cached ratio is refreshed\n\n// The caller owns the returned pointer.\n// The policy must outlive the channel �� destroy the channel before the policy.\nstd::unique_ptr<brpc::BackupRequestPolicy> policy(\n    brpc::CreateRateLimitedBackupPolicy(opts));\n\nbrpc::ChannelOptions options;\noptions.backup_request_policy = policy.get(); // NOT owned by channel\nchannel.Init(..., &options);\n// channel must be destroyed before policy goes out of scope.\n```\n\n`RateLimitedBackupPolicyOptions` fields:\n\n| Field | Default | Description |\n|-------|---------|-------------|\n| `backup_request_ms` | -1 | Timeout threshold in ms. -1 means inherit from `ChannelOptions.backup_request_ms` (only works when the policy is set via `ChannelOptions.backup_request_policy`; at controller level there is no channel-level fallback, so set an explicit >= 0 value instead). Must be >= -1. |\n| `max_backup_ratio` | 0.1 | Max backup ratio; range (0, 1] |\n| `window_size_seconds` | 10 | Sliding window width in seconds; range [1, 3600] |\n| `update_interval_seconds` | 5 | Cached-ratio refresh interval in seconds; must be >= 1 |\n\n`CreateRateLimitedBackupPolicy` returns `nullptr` if any parameter is invalid.\n", "title": "Using the built-in rate-limiting policy"}, "name": "Using the built-in rate-limiting policy", "qualified_name": "docs/en/backup_request.md#c2468c9d42c0dc4c", "relation": "DOCUMENTS", "repo_id": "repo:074b46c6e95703171fcd66ba04121d7fcacc04ef0fa2e0085f37e49cc4137eac", "shard_id": null, "signature": null, "source_hash": "0856cd97edcf079acd24645de92589ccec2c0dd4a70b42aceb8e5c4532edd896", "start_line": 48}], "returned_evidence_count": 6, "returned_evidence_ids": ["E-CODE-20376c6ce1b46be66b8a2d4a", "E-XLINK-02e59d12b69fb54749eacbc0", "E-XLINK-d0c193c0b2c38994b2ee0476", "E-DOC-3d047e723af4c7446012da31", "E-DOC-9d9674320ddc2684f8d2773a", "E-SHARD-26c1a7f4ef4488b736bb987f"], "summary": "Struct brpc.RateLimitedBackupPolicyOptions struct", "supporting_evidence": [{"commit": "ae09e960c7291605dda52356cc0c2d45567fb53e", "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_id": "E-XLINK-02e59d12b69fb54749eacbc0", "generation": 1, "kind": "CROSS_LAYER_LINK", "metadata": {"bundle_profile": "module_understanding", "bundle_role": "SUPPORTING", "bundle_seed_role": "SUPPORTING", "direct": true, "distance": 1, "document_path": "docs/cn/backup_request.md", "fact_id": "edge:7a9a7e6880176489ebd82706815c202d24d9727fc23c8a649b87e42c55c7026f", "layer": "knowledge", "raw_evidence_link_id": "evidence:b4af9ca732efb544ac5a5aa9a98bcd09a17fe38de5bc6ac91123029be9c74d8e", "resolution_status": "resolved"}, "provenance": "explicit_symbol_reference", "relation": "DOCUMENTS", "repository": "repo:074b46c6e95703171fcd66ba04121d7fcacc04ef0fa2e0085f37e49cc4137eac", "source_id": "documentsection:dcf07b60c9d54b6886a55e652c19b75f9f8bca778462868f93047202eabf1cff", "source_path": "docs/cn/backup_request.md", "source_range": {"end_line": 83, "start_line": 48}, "summary": "docs/cn/backup_request.md#51ec7f3ff1e31ea8 DOCUMENTS brpc.RateLimitedBackupPolicyOptions", "target_id": "symbol:2a658d6b8e9dbe3e8d348c9f6f440f9bf6261a51e9baeec599633e035a3b9c6d"}, {"commit": "ae09e960c7291605dda52356cc0c2d45567fb53e", "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_id": "E-XLINK-d0c193c0b2c38994b2ee0476", "generation": 1, "kind": "CROSS_LAYER_LINK", "metadata": {"bundle_profile": "module_understanding", "bundle_role": "SUPPORTING", "bundle_seed_role":